/* What's New pane (2.13.1) */
"keykey.whatsNew.summary" = "In 速成, typing on past a two-key code now moves to the next character instead of leaving you stuck.";
"keykey.whatsNew.simplexThirdRadical" = "A 速成 code is two keys — the first and last 倉頡 radical — so once you have typed both, the character is settled. Starting the next character used to add that key to the code you had just finished, making a three-key code that no 速成 table contains: the candidate list emptied and the character could no longer be picked at all. A third key now finishes the character in progress, taking the candidate the space bar would have taken, and begins the next one.";

